{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他心里浮起一点期待，却说不清它从何而来，也辨不出自己究竟在盼什么。\",\n          \"key\": \"未名期待\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [],\n      \"center_relation\": \"还说不清\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"无\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这一读法抓住了开头隐约的吸引感，将主要感受理解为尚未找到对象的期待，没有替他指定具体愿望。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选12\",\n        \"候选13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他心里有股隐约的抵触，却说不清它针对什么；那股劲刚出现，便显出几分迟疑。\",\n          \"key\": \"无对象的抵触\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [],\n      \"center_relation\": \"还说不清\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"无\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这一读法把重点放在内心不肯顺从的倾向上，而不是对某种事物的向往；这种抵触有听感依据，但其对象仍须保持未知。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选9\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他对自己的感受有些戒备，连第一反应也不敢全信，心里因此显得拘谨。\",\n          \"key\": \"不信第一感觉\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [],\n      \"center_relation\": \"还说不清\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"无\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 6,\n      \"why\": \"这一读法把主要感受理解为对自身判断缺乏信任，与开头的游移感相符，但比单纯的迷惘多了一层自我怀疑的推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选9\",\n        \"候选10\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f5e314f-dc61-4812-a8cd-06e3aae7ade8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T115827155354Z", "elapsed_seconds": 140.813, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T12:00:47.983014+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary